{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119326","id":3647024483,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZYS1j","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119326","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119326.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119326.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119326","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119326/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119326/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119326/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/66cdbfa4049e90b3115ec3ad594f1d47617fbacd","number":119326,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `[ExportName]` support for C# exported properties to customize Inspector labels","user":{"login":"tp1415926535","id":58326584,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzI2NTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58326584?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535","html_url":"https://github.com/tp1415926535","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nAdd support for `[ExportName]` on C# exported members so the Inspector can display a custom label without changing the underlying property name.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- add `Godot.ExportNameAttribute` in GodotSharp\r\n- update the source generator to emit an optional display name for exported properties\r\n- pass the display name through the C# bridge/native interop layer\r\n- store display names in `CSharpScript` editor metadata\r\n- make the Inspector prefer the custom display name when available\r\n- add source generator test coverage\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nThis only affects the Inspector display label. \r\nProperty keys, get/set behavior, and serialization names are unchanged.\r\n\r\n## Example\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n[Export]\r\n[ExportName(\"Short Name\")]\r\npublic string LongPropertyNameInTheCsharpScript { get; set; }\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Related\r\n\r\n- Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#3510","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/